 to 16 waypoints. Consecutive waypoints must differ,\n    and the final destination must differ from the origin. Every leg must be in range.\n    Your route is checked when you send it and again before each departure."]," ",["H3",{"class":"svelte-1uu63d4"},"Drafts and orders"]," ",["P",{"class":"svelte-1uu63d4"},"Selecting waypoints moves no forces. Discard draft clears only your unsent\n    route. Send fleet requests an order; wait for its acknowledgement before\n    treating it as accepted. Cancel order is a separate action in Fleet\n    preparation, available only before its cancellation cutoff. Traveling fleets\n    cannot be redirected or canceled. Pauses preserve routes and delay progress."]," ",["H3",{"class":"svelte-1uu63d4"},"Arrival and uncertainty"]," ",["P",{"class":"svelte-1uu63d4"},"Ownership and defenders may have changed since the last observation.\n    Nonallied arrivals resolve combat automatically. Fighters contest orbit;\n    surviving infantry are needed to claim a surface. Winning orbit alone does\n    not give you the surface. Review the recorded arrival outcome before making\n    another plan."]]," "]," ",["BUTTON",{"class":"secondary"},"Review route",""]]]],[[85,71]]],[[104,1969]],[[104,1970]],[[104,1971]],[[104,1972]],[[104,1973]],[[104,1974]]]],[[106,80]],[[104,1978]],[[106,81]],[[106,82]]],[[106,84]]]],"viewport":{"width":1440,"height":1000},"timestamp":24621.988,"wallTime":1767360600000,"collectionTime":5,"resourceOverrides":[],"isMainFrame":true}}
